From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: brennoflavio <contato@brennoflavio.com.br>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:45:27 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] webapi: add native silent audio analyser nodes

Expose AnalyserNode and BaseAudioContext.createAnalyser with native
inheritance, options, validated properties and bounded typed-array
readbacks for the source-free audio graph. Silence uses standard float
and byte representations, independent of host audio hardware.

Support analyser routing and disconnect overloads while preserving
destination sink behavior. Own nodes in reclaimable arenas, retain their
context and connected wrappers, and remove listener/signal roots safely
on collection. Coerce channel enums through Web IDL string conversion.

Pass audio-analyser-functional: benchmark 123/130, existing tests
1658/1658, and 203 temporary API/GC checks. Non-silent sources, offline
rendering and spectral processing remain outside this patch.
